  "summary": {
    "zh": "整合订单/WBS 的实际、计划、预算和承诺，形成只读 EAC 与预算风险。",
    "en": "Combines order/WBS actual, plan, budget, and commitments into a read-only EAC and budget-risk assessment."
  },
  "status": "Three-stage live acceptance blocked",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "owner": "CO-OM-OPA / PS",
